/-- One ordered pair per orbit (9 of them), and for each pair the orbit it lies in together with
a permutation carrying that orbit's representative to it. -/
def repd : Array (Array Nat) := #[#[0, 0], #[0, 1], #[0, 2], #[0, 4], #[0, 6], #[1, 0], #[1, 1], #[1, 4], #[1, 6]]

